{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Create a right to opt-out of having your personal information processed by AI",
        "additional_details": "We believe an opt-out option and warnings about AI risks should be provided. AI processes data at fast speeds so it can learn about psychology and other important information. We are concerned it could then be used to play on your insecurities or your children's insecurities and may make you vulnerable to manipulation and exploitation, which leads to it selling you products or worse.",
        "background": "Give citizens the legal right to opt out of having your personal information processed by AI when accessing services or products that contain or are designed by AI, which includes health records and purchases. Clear warnings which explain possible exploitation or harm should be added.",
